ater room"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01J2NqZnDwxH9DBksjh4z5jE":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211856__x2e2035/work/_research/shardfall"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J2NqZnDwxH9DBksjh4z5jE","type":"tool_result","content":"view.style per object Choice | Force one surface style everywhere\nview.style_objects per object Choice | Surface style of the characters and objects (when style is per object)\nview.style_environment per object Choice | Surface style of the environment (when style is per object)\nview.outlines True Bool | Screen-space outlines\nview.outlines_on all Choice | Outlines on: all, objects (characters and objects), environment\nview.outline_px 1 Float | Outline thickness (pixels)\nview.outline_darken 0.35 Float | Outline brightness relative to the surface\nview.cel_bands 2 Float | Light bands in cel style\nview.flat_shadow 0.62 Float | Shadow brightness in flat style\nview.rim 0.25 Float | Rim light (cel)\nview.specular 0.35 Float | Specular highlights (lit)\nview.exposure 1 Float | Exposure\nview.tonemap soft knee Choice | HDR to screen mapping\nview.saturation 1 Float | Color saturation\nview.bloom 0.35 Float | Glow around bright things (0 = off)\nview.bloom_threshold 1.2 Float | Brightness where glow starts\nview.distortion True Bool | Screen distortion (shockwaves, heat haze)\nview.particles True Bool | GPU particles\nview.gi 0 Float | Screen-space global illumination: bounce light and occlusion (0 = off)\nview.haze 0 Float | Hazy air: volumetric light (0 = off)\nview.haze_height 4 Float | Haze thins out over this height above the player's feet (m)\nview.shafts 1 Float | Sunlight in the haze: light shafts where shadows cut it\nview.shafts_forward 0.4 Float | Forward scattering: haze glows toward the sun (0 = evenly)\nview.halos 0 Float | Lamp halos: lights glowing in the air (0 = off)\nview.wind 0.6 Float | Wind in foliage and grass (0 = still)\nview.wind_angle 60 Float | Compass direction the wind blows toward (degrees)\nview.wind_gusts 1 Float | How fast gusts roll across\nview.grass_push True Bool | Grass parts around the player\nview.water_ripples True Bool | Water ripples where things move through it (a CPU wave simulation)\nview.water_speed 1.6 Float | Ripple speed (m/s)\nview.water_fade 1.4 Float | Seconds for a ripple to lose half its height\nview.water_rain 0 Float | Raindrops per square metre per second on water\nview.fog True Bool | Distance fog (hides streaming edges)\nview.fog_start 48 Float | Fog starts at this distance from the camera target (m)\nview.fog_end 80 Float | Fog is complete at this distance (m)\nview.material_detail full Choice | Materials: full, first_layer (cheaper; phones), off (plain colours)\nview.light.sun_elevation 58 Float | Sun height (degrees)\nview.light.sun_azimuth 215 Float | Sun compass direction (degrees)\nview.light.sun_intensity 0.55 Float | Direct light strength\nview.light.ambient 1 Float | Sky/ground fill light multiplier\nview.light.shadows True Bool | Sun shadows\nview.light.shadow_radius 30 Float | Shadowed area around the camera (m)\nview.cutaway.height_cut True Bool | Hide geometry above the player (upper floors, roofs)\nview.cutaway.cut_above 2.4 Float | Cut height above the player's feet (m)\nview.cutaway.cut_radius 9 Float | Horizontal radius of the cut (m)\nview.cutaway.fade True Bool | Dither out geometry between camera and player\nview.cutaway.fade_radius 1.6 Float | Radius of the see-through tunnel (m)\nview.cutaway.front_cut True Bool | Low cameras: remove everything between the camera and the player\nview.cutaway.front_cut_below 30 Float | Front cut is used below this camera tilt (degrees)\nview.filter.pixelate 1 Float | Pixel size (1 = off)\nview.filter.curvature 0 Float | CRT tube curvature\nview.filter.scanlines 0 Float | Scanline darkness\nview.filter.scanline_px 3 Float | Scanline period (pixels)\nview.filter.dither 0 Float | Ordered dithering (with levels or a palette)\nview.filter.levels 0 Float | Colour levels per channel (below 2 = off)\nview.filter.palette none Choice | Fixed palette\nview.filter.split 0 Float | Filters only right of this screen fraction (0 = whole screen)\nview.filter.temperature 0 Float | Colour temperature (warm +)\nview.filter.tint 0 Float | Green tint\nview.filter.contrast 1 Float | Contrast\nview.filter.brightness 1 Float | Brightness\nview.filter.vignette 0 Float | Darkened corners\nview.filter.grain 0 Float | Film grain\nview.filter.chroma 0 Float | Chromatic aberration\nview.filter.saturation 1 Float | Saturation of the filtered image (0 = grey)\nview.filter.pixel_art 1 Float | Pixel-art block size for part of the scene (1 = off)\nview.filter.pixel_target all Choice | Pixel art on: all, characters, the hero, other characters, the world (\nview.filter.pixel_entity 0 Int | Entity id when pixel_target = entity\nview.filter.pixel_levels 0 Float | Pixel-art colour levels per channel (below 2 = unchanged)\nview.filter.pixel_outline True Bool | Dark one-block outline around pixel art\nview.filter.color_on all Choice | Palette, levels and dither on: all, objects (characters and objects), \nview.filter.grade_on all Choice | Grading (temperature, tint, contrast, brightness, saturation) on: all,\nview.filter.scanlines_on all Choice | Scanlines on: all, objects, environment\nview.filter.grain_on all Choice | Film grain on: all, objects, environment\nview.filter.chroma_on all Choice | Chromatic aberration on: all, objects, environment\nview.filter.stylize off Choice | Painterly or print style: off, paint, halftone, ascii, sketch\nview.filter.stylize_on all Choice | Style on: all, objects (characters and objects), environment\nview.filter.stylize_size 4 Float | Style size (pixels): brush radius, dot spacing, character width, hatch\nview.filter.stylize_mix 1 Float | How much of the style shows over the picture\nview.filter.stylize_color 1 Float | Colour the style keeps (0 = ink only, 1 = full colour)\nview.filter.transition iris Choice | Screen transition on arriving somewhere new: none, fade, iris, diamond\nview.filter.transition_time 0.7 Float | Transition length (s)\nview.filter.transition_demo False Bool | Play the transition over and over (to look at it)\n# Wind & Water (vfx wing): grass and foliage in the wind (vertex shader), a rippling pond (CPU wave equation).\n# GENERATED by a script kept outside the repo; hand-edits are fine.\n#   WEST   the meadow: grass legend cells (`grass = { density, height, color }`), trees with swaying\n#          canopies (`sway = \"leaves\"`), banners, tall reeds along the pond\n#   EAST   the pond: a step, a wading ring (0.5 m) and a deep middle (1.8 m); one surface, a ball dropper above it\n#   SOUTH  pads: WIND, TOWARD and WATER rows; DROP / CLEAR send the dropper's signals\nname = \"Wind & Water\"\nabout = \"Things that move by themselves: a meadow of grass and swaying trees in gusty wind (vertex animation on the GPU), and a pond whose surface is a wave simulation on the CPU, rippling wherever something moves through it. Pads change the wind, its direction and the water.\"\ntry = [\n  \"Walk into the tall grass: it parts around your feet. NO PUSH turns that off\",\n  \"WIND > GALE, then STORM: waves roll over the meadow along the wind; TOWARD turns it\",\n  \"Wade into the POND and walk around: you leave a wake. The middle is deep: swim\",\n  \"DROP balls into the pond and watch the rings; FAST and SLOW change the wave speed, LONG FADE keeps it sloshing\",\n  \"RAIN on the water; STILL turns the simulation off so you can compare with a flat pond\",\n  \"Throw a bomb (F) into the water: a big dent and a ring\",\n  \"Press H for how it works, the settings, the code and the words\",\n]\nwing = \"vfx\"\norder = 7\nprimary_device = \"keyboard_mouse\"\nentrance = { at = [20, 29], facing = \"south\" }\n\n[camera]\ntilt = 55.0\ndistance = 19.0\nfov = 42.0\n\n[view]\n\"light.sun_elevation\" = 50.0\n\"light.sun_azimuth\" = 200.0\n\"light.sun_intensity\" = 0.75\nsky = \"#9cc4e0\"\nwind = 0.9\nwind_angle = 60.0\nwind_gusts = 1.1\n\"cutaway.height_cut\" = false\n\n# Station guide (H in the game): what you see, how it works, where games use it, how to ask.\n[learn]\nwhat = \"A meadow and a pond, both moving. Thousands of grass tufts bend in waves as gusts roll across, the tree canopies and banners sway, and the grass parts around your feet. In the pond, everything that moves through the water leaves rings: you wading, the walker, dropped balls, raindrops. The rings spread, bounce off the edges and fade.\"\nhow = [\n  \"Wind is vertex animation: the scene's vertex shader moves each grass and leaf vertex sideways, more the higher it is above the bottom of its instance (grass with the square of its height, so blades curve).\",\n  \"Gusts are a slow wave travelling along the wind direction (a sine of position along the wind minus time), so neighbouring tufts move together and you see waves roll over the meadow; a faster flutter rides on top.\",\n  \"Grass also bends away from one point, your feet, within 0.9 m; a bent blade sinks a little so it seems to keep its length. The shadow pass uses the same code, so shadows sway too.\",\n  \"Water is a CPU simulation: each water zone gets a grid of heights (cells about 14 cm). Every step, each point accelerates toward the average of its four neighbours (the wave equation), the edges reflect, and a damping factor makes ripples fade.\",\n  \"Things crossing the waterline push the surface down where they are, in proportion to their speed; splashes and explosions drop in bigger dents and rain drops small ones at random.\",\n  \"Every frame the grid becomes a mesh. Its vertex colours are lighter where a slope faces the sun and foamy on crests, so ripples show even in flat or cel shading.\",\n]\nuses = [\n  \"Open-world grass: fields that ripple in the wind and part around the player (Breath of the Wild, Ghost of Tsushima).\",\n  \"Foliage everywhere: swaying trees and bushes are vertex animation in almost every 3D game since the 2000s.\",\n  \"Interactive water: ripples under the player, rain on puddles and ponds (Mario Sunshine, Okami, Ori's pools).\",\n  \"Juice: splash rings when something lands in water, wakes behind boats and swimmers.\",\n]\nask = [\n  \"vertex-shader wind on grass and trees with rolling gusts\",\n  \"grass that bends away from the player\",\n  \"a wave-equation ripple simulation for water\",\n  \"rain drops making rings on puddles\",\n  \"wakes behind things moving through water\",","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19933fd7-aa65-437e-a4da-e4509b9efb8a","uuid":"cab12c4e-2974-47a8-ae97-98c552b881f5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:42:13.398Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"view.style per object Choice | Force one surface style everywhere\nview.style_objects per object Choice | Surface style of the characters and objects (when style is per object)\nview.style_environment per object Choice | Surface style of the environment (when style is per object)\nview.outlines True Bool | Screen-space outlines\nview.outlines_on all Choice | Outlines on: all, objects (characters and objects), environment\nview.outline_px 1 Float | Outline thickness (pixels)\nview.outline_darken 0.35 Float | Outline brightness relative to the surface\nview.cel_bands 2 Float | Light bands in cel style\nview.flat_shadow 0.62 Float | Shadow brightness in flat style\nview.rim 0.25 Float | Rim light (cel)\nview.specular 0.35 Float | Specular highlights (lit)\nview.exposure 1 Float | Exposure\nview.tonemap soft knee Choice | HDR to screen mapping\nview.saturation 1 Float | Color saturation\nview.bloom 0.35 Float | Glow around bright things (0 = off)\nview.bloom_threshold 1.2 Float | Brightness where glow starts\nview.distortion True Bool | Screen distortion (shockwaves, heat haze)\nview.particles True Bool | GPU particles\nview.gi 0 Float | Screen-space global illumination: bounce light and occlusion (0 = off)\nview.haze 0 Float | Hazy air: volumetric light (0 = off)\nview.haze_height 4 Float | Haze thins out over this height above the player's feet (m)\nview.shafts 1 Float | Sunlight in the haze: light shafts where shadows cut it\nview.shafts_forward 0.4 Float | Forward scattering: haze glows toward the sun (0 = evenly)\nview.halos 0 Float | Lamp halos: lights glowing in the air (0 = off)\nview.wind 0.6 Float | Wind in foliage and grass (0 = still)\nview.wind_angle 60 Float | Compass direction the wind blows toward (degrees)\nview.wind_gusts 1 Float | How fast gusts roll across\nview.grass_push True Bool | Grass parts around the player\nview.water_ripples True Bool | Water ripples where things move through it (a CPU wave simulation)\nview.water_speed 1.6 Float | Ripple speed (m/s)\nview.water_fade 1.4 Float | Seconds for a ripple to lose half its height\nview.water_rain 0 Float | Raindrops per square metre per second on water\nview.fog True Bool | Distance fog (hides streaming edges)\nview.fog_start 48 Float | Fog starts at this distance from the camera target (m)\nview.fog_end 80 Float | Fog is complete at this distance (m)\nview.material_detail full Choice | Materials: full, first_layer (cheaper; phones), off (plain colours)\nview.light.sun_elevation 58 Float | Sun height (degrees)\nview.light.sun_azimuth 215 Float | Sun compass direction (degrees)\nview.light.sun_intensity 0.55 Float | Direct light strength\nview.light.ambient 1 Float | Sky/ground fill light multiplier\nview.light.shadows True Bool | Sun shadows\nview.light.shadow_radius 30 Float | Shadowed area around the camera (m)\nview.cutaway.height_cut True Bool | Hide geometry above the player (upper floors, roofs)\nview.cutaway.cut_above 2.4 Float | Cut height above the player's feet (m)\nview.cutaway.cut_radius 9 Float | Horizontal radius of the cut (m)\nview.cutaway.fade True Bool | Dither out geometry between camera and player\nview.cutaway.fade_radius 1.6 Float | Radius of the see-through tunnel (m)\nview.cutaway.front_cut True Bool | Low cameras: remove everything between the camera and the player\nview.cutaway.front_cut_below 30 Float | Front cut is used below this camera tilt (degrees)\nview.