r of preference:\n   1. Procedural: code and data that generate the asset.\n   2. Text/data: formats agents read and edit directly.\n   3. Binary: only with human approval. Approved: fonts (WOFF2, TTF, OTF).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Rp9nBPCkt97ZY8tBF9gRsk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
