{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RNCbxBWKzga5qwSMa67QLC","type":"tool_result","content":"  632 10168 63346 PLAN.md\n11:- **Verified** means it was run on this computer on 2026-11-04, against engine commit `49ef2ba` and AI Hub client 1.4.0. Section 15 lists those results.\n25 section 4\n50 section 12\n115 section 14\n123:**Every event has:** a section of tunable numbers in `rules.toml`, a bot that earns at least 2 stars, an idle-input outcome below 1 star, a ghost lane, and an attract segment. Scenes `fit/event/<name>` start an event directly, for tools and tests.\n139 section 10\n149 section 15\n199 section 8\n335 section 14\n356 section 18\n385 section 14\n501:| `pav_audio` | Section 10 | Music, voices, buses |\n574 section 11\n596 section 18\n610:| Brief item | Section |\n5:## 0. How to read this plan\n15:## 1. The game in one page\n48:## 2. Structure of play\n74:## 3. Controls\n94:## 4. The Balance Core\n119:## 5. Events\n181:## 6. Meta systems\n192:## 7. World, cast and writing\n227:## 8. Art direction\n283:## 9. Animation\n308:## 10. Audio\n333:## 11. UI and UX\n371:## 12. Attract mode\n377:## 13. Multiplayer\n443:## 14. Architecture\n520:## 15. Verified facts and traps\n557:## 16. Testing\n582:## 17. Build order\n600:## 18. Finishing","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19933fd7-aa65-437e-a4da-e4509b9efb8a","uuid":"2755d0f6-769f-466e-a8e4-d8954d6de541","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:16:38.079Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  632 10168 63346 PLAN.md\n11:- **Verified** means it was run on this computer on 2026-11-04, against engine commit `49ef2ba` and AI Hub client 1.4.0. Section 15 lists those results.\n25 section 4\n50 section 12\n115 section 14\n123:**Every event has:** a section of tunable numbers in `rules.toml`, a bot that earns at least 2 stars, an idle-input outcome below 1 star, a ghost lane, and an attract segment. Scenes `fit/event/<name>` start an event directly, for tools and tests.\n139 section 10\n149 section 15\n199 section 8\n335 section 14\n356 section 18\n385 section 14\n501:| `pav_audio` | Section 10 | Music, voices, buses |\n574 section 11\n596 section 18\n610:| Brief item | Section |\n5:## 0. How to read this plan\n15:## 1. The game in one page\n48:## 2. Structure of play\n74:## 3. Controls\n94:## 4. The Balance Core\n119:## 5. Events\n181:## 6. Meta systems\n192:## 7. World, cast and writing\n227:## 8. Art direction\n283:## 9. Animation\n308:## 10. Audio\n333:## 11. UI and UX\n371:## 12. Attract mode\n377:## 13. Multiplayer\n443:## 14. Architecture\n520:## 15. Verified facts and traps\n557:## 16. Testing\n582:## 17. Build order\n600:## 18. Finishing","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RNCbxBWKzga5qwSMa67QLC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
