d:**\n- **Fun:** no event exists yet, so whether they're enjoyable is unproven. Only the balance dot's starting numbers were checked, by simulation.\n- **Engine changes:** the other changes the plan lists, like the figure's tilt and the chase camera's yaw, come from reading the code and haven't been run.\n\nIf a builder runs short of time, the plan gives a cut order (Tray Trek, Floatie Spin, Plank Standoff), because I don't know which models or how much time builders will have. I raised that and the unclear \"on its own\" multiplayer wording in the exit interview.\n\nI deleted my 2.6 GB research folder and committed nothing.\n\nSources: [Wii Fit on Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wii_Fit)","ttft_ms":1008,"type":"result","duration_ms":3589266,"uuid":"acc13414-243f-432d-8ecf-aa759d76424a","ttft_stream_ms":909,"time_to_request_ms":86,"first_content_frame_ms":910,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":166,"outputTokens":234876,"cacheReadInputTokens":29823889,"cacheCreationInputTokens":605024,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":15.503153800000007,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":138603,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":605024,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":13998,"outputTokens":1817,"cacheReadInputTokens":872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":470692,"webSearchRequests":1,"costUSD":0.308514,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":935,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":470692,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-03T10:53:37.765Z"}
